---
const links = [
  { href: '/posts/', label: '文章' },
  { href: '/archive/', label: '归档' },
  { href: '/about/', label: '关于' },
  { href: '/rss.xml', label: 'RSS' },
];
---

<aside class="left-panel" aria-label="作者与站点信息">
  <section class="side-card author-card">
    <div class="author-avatar" aria-hidden="true">A</div>
    <h2 class="author-name">AKAxiaobai-123</h2>
    <p class="author-bio">记录技术、生活与零碎日常，把日子一层层叠起来。</p>
    <div class="author-links">
      <a href="/about/">关于</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/AKAxiaobai-123" rel="me" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="side-card">
    <h2 class="side-title">公告</h2>
    <div class="announcement-body">
      <p>欢迎来到博客，这里正在慢慢长出新的内容。</p>
      <a class="announcement-link" href="/about/">了解更多</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="side-card">
    <h2 class="side-title">快捷导航</h2>
    <nav aria-label="快捷导航">
      <ul class="quick-nav">
        {
          links.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href}>
                <span>{link.label}</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </section>
</aside>
